{"id":"777baa75a4312c8e","group":"90","path":"90/90-df-berry-paradox.md","title":"Berry Paradox","display":"df-berry-paradox — Berry Paradox","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-df-berry-paradox","aliases":["90-df-berry-paradox"],"display":"df-berry-paradox — Berry Paradox","depends_on":[]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-df-berry-paradox"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-df-berry-paradox</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-berry-paradox — Berry Paradox"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> 是非空有限字母表，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Str}=\\Sigma^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\mathrm{Str}=\\Sigma^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell(D)=\\operatorname{dom}(D)\">\\(\\ell(D)=\\operatorname{dom}(D)\\)</span> 为有限字串的长度（将字串视为有限序列）。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>固定参数关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Defines}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Str}\\times\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathrm{Defines}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Str}\\times\\mathbb N\\)</span>，并要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall D,m,n\\,[\\mathrm{Defines}(D,m)\\land\\mathrm{Defines}(D,n)\\Rightarrow m=n]\">\\(\\forall D,m,n\\,[\\mathrm{Defines}(D,m)\\land\\mathrm{Defines}(D,n)\\Rightarrow m=n]\\)</span>。它不是从自然语言自动取得的真值谓词。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>固定字符串族 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathrm{Str}\">\\(B:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathrm{Str}\\)</span>，写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_k=B(k)\">\\(B_k=B(k)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Defines}\">\\(\\mathrm{Defines}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 为本定义环境的固定参数，跨环境不能混用同一 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Berry}\">\\(\\mathrm{Berry}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Def}\">\\(\\mathrm{Def}\\)</span> 为本原子在下式引入、量化绑定或仅作层级/排版标签的记号；其参数次序与适用域由相应公式固定，不作为额外的未声明外部对象。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Def}_{&lt;k}(m)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists D\\in\\mathrm{Str}\\ [\\ell(D)&lt;k\\land\\mathrm{Defines}(D,m)],\\\\\nb_k&amp;:=\\min\\{m\\in\\mathbb N:\\neg\\mathrm{Def}_{&lt;k}(m)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Berry}(k)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\ell(B_k)&lt;k\\land\\mathrm{Defines}(B_k,b_k),\\\\\n\\bigl|\\{m:\\mathrm{Def}_{&lt;k}(m)\\}\\bigr|&amp;&lt;\\infty,\\qquad\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\neg\\mathrm{Berry}(k).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Def}_{&lt;k}(m)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists D\\in\\mathrm{Str}\\ [\\ell(D)&lt;k\\land\\mathrm{Defines}(D,m)],\\\\\nb_k&amp;:=\\min\\{m\\in\\mathbb N:\\neg\\mathrm{Def}_{&lt;k}(m)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Berry}(k)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\ell(B_k)&lt;k\\land\\mathrm{Defines}(B_k,b_k),\\\\\n\\bigl|\\{m:\\mathrm{Def}_{&lt;k}(m)\\}\\bigr|&amp;&lt;\\infty,\\qquad\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\neg\\mathrm{Berry}(k).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Proof\">[Proof]</h2>\n<p>长度小于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 的字串只有有限多个，单值关系使它们定义的数也只有有限多个；其补集非空，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b_k\">\\(b_k\\)</span> 存在且唯一。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Berry}(k)\">\\(\\mathrm{Berry}(k)\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_k\">\\(B_k\\)</span> 本身见证 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Def}_{&lt;k}(b_k)\">\\(\\mathrm{Def}_{&lt;k}(b_k)\\)</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b_k\">\\(b_k\\)</span> 的选取矛盾。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保留原关系、最小不可定义数和 Berry 条件。候选字串 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_k\">\\(B_k\\)</span> 不因中文释义而获得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Defines}\">\\(\\mathrm{Defines}\\)</span> 属性；若强加该属性且长度小于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span>，才与固定解释的单值性及最小值定义冲突。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Proof","text":"[Proof]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Str}=\\Sigma^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\ell(D)=\\operatorname{dom}(D)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Defines}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Str}\\times\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall D,m,n\\,[\\mathrm{Defines}(D,m)\\land\\mathrm{Defines}(D,n)\\Rightarrow m=n]","display":false},{"tex":"B:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathrm{Str}","display":false},{"tex":"B_k=B(k)","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Defines}","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Berry}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Def}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Def}_{<k}(m)&\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists D\\in\\mathrm{Str}\\ [\\ell(D)<k\\land\\mathrm{Defines}(D,m)],\\\\\nb_k&:=\\min\\{m\\in\\mathbb N:\\neg\\mathrm{Def}_{<k}(m)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Berry}(k)&\\Longleftrightarrow\\ell(B_k)<k\\land\\mathrm{Defines}(B_k,b_k),\\\\\n\\bigl|\\{m:\\mathrm{Def}_{<k}(m)\\}\\bigr|&<\\infty,\\qquad\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\neg\\mathrm{Berry}(k).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"b_k","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Berry}(k)","display":false},{"tex":"B_k","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Def}_{<k}(b_k)","display":false},{"tex":"b_k","display":false},{"tex":"B_k","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Defines}","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false}],"bytes":1954,"backlinks":[{"id":"5cc312c6e3fc50d2","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"b767163b85aaf61c","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"da1a6647840ffca5","anchor":"ref-93","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-df-berry-paradox]]"},{"id":"32c1f47762a7f658","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-df-1-consistency.md]]\n[[90-df-addition-function.md]]\n[[90-df-arithmetic-language.md]]\n[[90-df-arithmetization.md]]\n[[90-df-berry-paradox.md]]\n[[90-df-cantor-diagonal.md]]\n[[90-df-closure-operator.md]]\n[[90-df-comparison-function.md]]\n[[90-df-compcode.md]]\n[[90-df-composition-operator.md]]\n[[90-df-conditional-function.md]]\n[[90-df-conf-proj.md]]\n[[90-df-configuration.md]]\n[[90-df-consistency-statement.md]]\n[[90-df-creative-set.md]]\n[[90-df-decidable-theory.md]]\n[[90-df-diagonal-closure.md]]\n[[90-df-diagonal-function.md]]\n[[90-df-diagonal-lemma.md]]\n[[90-df-diagonalization.md]]\n[[90-df-divisibility.md]]\n[[90-df-divrem-function.md]]\n[[90-df-effective-procedure.md]]\n[[90-df-effectively-axiomatized-theory.md]]\n[[90-df-elementary-system-definition.md]]\n[[90-df-elementary-system.md]]\n[[90-df-essentially-undecidable.md]]\n[[90-df-factorial-function.md]]\n[[90-df-fixed-point-theorem.md]]\n[[90-df-fixed-point.md]]\n[[90-df-formula.md]]\n[[90-df-free-variable.md]]\n[[90-df-godel-number.md]]\n[[90-df-godel-numbering.md]]\n[[90-df-godel-sentence.md]]\n[[90-df-godel-system-definition.md]]\n[[90-df-godel-system.md]]\n[[90-df-halt-notation.md]]\n[[90-df-haltseq.md]]\n[[90-df-hbl-conditions.md]]\n[[90-df-henkin-sentence.md]]\n[[90-df-hypersimple-set.md]]\n[[90-df-incompletable-extension.md]]\n[[90-df-incompletable-theory.md]]\n[[90-df-isigma-hierarchy.md]]\n[[90-df-kleene-normal-form.md]]\n[[90-df-kolmogorov-complexity.md]]\n[[90-df-liar-par